# Content-addressed Ward Flow control-plane records. THE FILENAME IS THE SHA-256 OF THE FILE'S OWN
# CANONICAL JSON, so reformatting the content breaks the content-address and the record no longer
# hashes to its own name. Prettier collapsed two multi-line arrays on 2026-09-03 and
# tests/ward-flow-chat-control.test.ts went red with "is not canonical JSON". These are records,
# not source: they are written once by scripts/ward-flow/chat-control.mjs and never edited by hand.
