# The work-claims register is an APPEND-ONLY table five live chats write to at once, and prettier
# reformats all 63 rows as pure whitespace padding — which collides with every one of them.
# Owner-approved exemption, 2026-09-09. It is not avoidable by care: the chat that first reported
# the hazard hit it twice in one session, the second time while formatting its own changed files,
# which is correct practice. A rule that makes the right thing cheap keeps working when nobody is
# feeling scrupulous; five chats each remembering is not a control.
docs/ward-flow/control/work-claims.md

